      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**The whole year in one screen** (synthetic data). Top row = the four numbers to remember.\n**Net material contribution** is negative = customers pay much more for collection and treatment than they get back as material credit.\n**€ at stake** = estimated money behind all findings — things to *check*, not proven savings. Click the page names above to go deeper:\n**2 · Findings** (what went wrong) · **3 · Cost & weight** (€ per tonne, scale vs weighbridge) · **4 · Operators** (neutral scorecard) · **5 · Actions** (what a person should approve)."
      }
